1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,550
The tallest building on Earth
is only the beginning.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:07,150
Burj Khalifa rises 828 meters.

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:13,550
The Three Gorges Dam stretches about 2.3 kilometers,
nearly three Burj Khalifas.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:19,500
CERN's Large Hadron Collider forms
a 26.7-kilometer ring underground.

5
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:25,350
But Switzerland's Gotthard Base Tunnel runs
57.1 kilometers through the Alps.

6
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:30,300
End to end, almost 69 Burj Khalifas
would fit inside it.
